{"schema":"LAW_EN_DOCUMENT_V1","id":"i18n-ba8ac86fcf8cb642285bf2964bf35dc5c164f53b24054d91","family_id":"KR:012290","country":"KR","language":"en","title":"Enforcement Decree of the Special Act on Investigating the Truth of the April 16 Sewol Ferry Disaster and Building a Safe Society","title_original":"4ㆍ16세월호참사 진상규명 및 안전사회 건설 등을 위한 특별법 시행령","kind":"대통령령","source_version":"281677","promulgated":null,"effective":null,"translation_status":"AI_DRAFT","body_status":"BODY_LOADED","source_url":"https://www.law.go.kr/LSW/lsInfoP.do?lsiSeq=281677","source_sha256":"ff3863dbef2b663e57c1bb50e09c12a98d7d3453e51a869f8e704412139e0470","body_sha256":"b1a2aba8f55cd449eb49b4de596f53eddf0b9ee92f79b82546fe0c2cf191ed3a","article_count":1,"full_text":"Article 6 (Investigation Bureau)\n① The Director General of the Investigation Bureau shall be a special-service member of the Senior Executive Service, with the position classified as Job Grade B.\n② The Investigation Bureau shall have Investigation Divisions 1, 2, and 3. The head of Investigation Division 1 shall be a prosecutorial investigation secretary, and the heads of Investigation Divisions 2 and 3 shall be special-service public officials equivalent to Grade IV.\n③ The head of Investigation Division 1 shall be responsible for the following:\n1. Monitoring the progress of activities to ascertain the truth of the April 16 Sewol ferry disaster;\n2. Requesting the National Assembly to pass a resolution for the appointment of a special prosecutor in connection with the disaster;\n3. Analysis of the results of government investigations into the causes of the disaster;\n4. Investigation into the causes of the disaster;\n5. Support for the operation of the Truth Investigation Subcommittee under Article 16(1) 1 of the Act;\n6. Duties concerning accusations and requests for investigation under Article 28 of the Act, imposition of penalties under Article 51 of the Act (excluding matters falling under Article 7(2) 5 and Article 8(2) 4 of this Decree), accusations under Article 52 of the Act, and imposition and collection of administrative fines under Article 53 of the Act;\n7. Conduct of hearings under Article 31 of the Act;\n8. Preparation of reports on the results of investigations into matters within its jurisdiction;\n9. Preparation of the comprehensive report on matters under the jurisdiction of the Investigation Bureau.\n④ The head of Investigation Division 2 shall be responsible for the following:\n1. Analysis of government investigation materials concerning rescue and salvage operations related to the April 16 Sewol ferry disaster;\n2. Investigation of rescue and salvage operations related to that disaster;\n3. Investigation of the appropriateness of the Government's response in connection with the disaster;\n4. Preparation of reports on the results of investigations into matters within its jurisdiction.\n⑤ The head of Investigation Division 3 shall be responsible for the following:\n1. Investigation of the fairness and appropriateness of media reports concerning the April 16 Sewol ferry disaster;\n2. Investigation of the defamation of sufferers through postings on information and communications networks or by other means in connection with that disaster;\n3. Collection and preservation of materials concerning the disaster;\n4. Preparation of reports on the results of investigations into matters within its jurisdiction.\n","metadata":{"author_method":"Exact held-source units translated or completed using explicitly recorded source/target spans; original official records remain unchanged. All new units are MACHINE_TRANSLATION and UNREVIEWED.","author_title_record":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1525_KR012159\\translations\\decree\\en.title.json","sha256":"5fcdc2a396f6cb5050ca3aa8dd7c252bb349913fcd2e730347909ef17576559f"},"author_unit_artifacts":[{"json":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별